title Pane
rem The start page. Every page here is plain text in Tiny's UI language.
align center
col
  w 100%
  maxw 720
  pad 20
  gap 12
  fnt 28
  fg 235 240 255
  txt Pane
  fnt 14
  fg 170 190 220
  txt A small browser for pages written in Tiny's UI language. Pages are plain text: one word per line says what to show, and end closes a group.
  div
  fnt 16
  fg 235 240 255
  txt Sample pages
  fnt 14
  lnk Article: long text that wraps and scrolls article
  lnk Settings: rows, switches and a text field settings
  lnk Calculator: buttons and statements calculator
  lnk Table: rows of cells table
  lnk Gallery: a grid of cards gallery
  lnk Widgets: every control, with live values widgets
  lnk Panels: tabs, an accordion and a dialog panels
  lnk Layout: grow, align, percentages, min and max layout
  lnk Clock: a timer, a progress bar and a spinner clock
  div
  fg 120 140 170
  fnt 12
  txt Type a page name or an address above. Back and forward keep your place on each page.
end
